WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Let's put Claude on your phone.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Open the App Store or Play Store and install Claude.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Sign up or sign in — the code comes by email.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Start a new project called Inbox.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Paste your email helper into project instructions.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Your trainer takes it from there.
